# Shark Bite Mouth Black Fill

After chroma keys the chomp plate, call fillMouthInteriorBlack on stripPlate frames: (1) O(w*h) enclosed-hole fill for cavities surrounded by shark body, (2) paint transparent pixels inside mouthBlackCx/Cy/Rx/Ry ellipse opaque black. Do not overwrite video assets.

